<Layout title="About LINKSZN"><article class="prose"><div class="eyebrow">LINKSZN / ABOUT</div><h1>About LINKSZN</h1><p>LINKSZN is an independent deals publication focused on finding worthwhile Woot offers across every category. Our editorial standard is simple: publish only verified steals at least 40% below real market prices.</p><h2>How we watch for deals</h2><p>Our monitoring window is 8 AM to midnight Eastern Time. We cover Home &amp; Kitchen, Electronics, Computers, Tools &amp; Garden, Sports &amp; Outdoors, Shirt, Grocery &amp; Household, and Clearance. Each published find includes the time posted and the date its prices were checked.</p><h2>Real prices, not inflated reference prices</h2><p>We compare matching models, sizes, quantities, and condition against available retailer offers. We use the lowest qualifying comparison price we found as our benchmark. A manufacturer's suggested price or Woot reference price alone is not enough to qualify. We round savings down and explain coupons, warranty differences, or other restrictions.</p><p>Our comparisons are a dated snapshot, not a promise that we have found every seller or that a price is still available. Taxes and shipping vary and are excluded unless a post says otherwise. Refurbished and open-box products must be compared on that same basis.</p><h2>Editorial independence</h2><p>Affiliate compensation does not change our 40% threshold. We write original buying context, including who a product fits and the limitations worth checking. We do not claim hands-on testing unless a post expressly describes it.</p><p>Follow <a href="https://x.com/LINKSZN">@LINKSZN on X</a> or <a href="/contact/">send us a correction</a>.</p></article></Layout>
